# Givers who lie (docs/DESIGN.md, "Story blocks"; Missions/Story/RZ_Grey.c): when you found what a
# brief left out, any leader of the giver's faction can hear it. Taking it public costs that faction
# 1 morale (capped) and an outpost giver 5 loyalty. It pays nothing: the truth is the payoff.

conv haven.leader.brief_lie
for leader:haven
when knows:brieflie.haven
topic "Tell them what the brief left out."
prio reaction
voice haven

node start
  say "Go on. If one of ours told you half of it, the house should hear the other half."
  > @tell "Tell them what you found." -> told
  > @keep "Keep it to yourself." -> kept

node told
  say "Right. I'll read it out at supper. Nobody will enjoy it."
  do call:brief_public
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node kept
  say "Your call. Some things go quieter if you let them."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

conv bastion.leader.brief_lie
for leader:bastion
when knows:brieflie.bastion
topic "Report what the brief left out."
prio reaction
voice bastion

node start
  say "A brief that wasn't straight. Put it in a report. Short."
  > @tell "Report it." -> told
  > @keep "Leave it out of the record." -> kept

node told
  say "Received. It goes up the chain, such as the chain is."
  do call:brief_public
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node kept
  say "Not reported, then. I didn't hear it either."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

conv redhand.leader.brief_lie
for leader:redhand
when knows:brieflie.redhand
topic "Tell the crew what the job left out."
prio reaction
voice redhand

node start
  say "Somebody sold you a job short? Careful. The crew likes a story, and it'll want a name."
  > @tell "Tell the crew." -> told
  > @keep "Let it lie." -> kept

node told
  say "That'll go round the fires by dark. Somebody's evening just got worse."
  do call:brief_public
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node kept
  say "Good. A secret's worth more kept. Remember who owes you for it."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

conv halcyon.leader.brief_lie
for leader:halcyon
when knows:brieflie.halcyon
topic "Report what the brief left out."
prio reaction
voice halcyon

node start
  say "A discrepancy in a brief. The lab takes discrepancies seriously, on paper."
  > @tell "Put it on the record." -> told
  > @keep "Leave it off the record." -> kept

node told
  say "Recorded. The director will be told. The director won't thank either of us."
  do call:brief_public
  > @back "Something else." -> hub

node kept
  say "Off the record, then. There's a lot off the record."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub
